# Editor Functionality

## Slide Elements
The editor supports various elements for slides: text blocks, images, shapes, icons, charts, and videos.

## Layout Management
Supports layouts: single column, two/three columns, icon grids, image+text, and card grids.

## Editing Features
Features include drag-drop, resize, styling, grid alignment, and auto-adaptation.

## AI Integration
Includes text generation, image generation, and layout suggestions.

## Export Options
Supports PDF, PPTX, PNG images, and HTML web presentations.